    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d300">

                <pb facs="0387" n="275" xml:id="pg275"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 711.18/12</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Costa Rica</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Johnson</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">San José</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1918-11-20T09:00:00-05:36">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">November 20, 1918, 9 a.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Your November 19, noon. Exact text to the best of my recollection pertinent part
                    of my brief remarks.</p>
                <quote rend="blockquote">
                    <p>The news as just received announce a proclamation by President Wilson in
                        which he says that it will now be our fortunate duty to assist by example,
                        by sober friendly counsel, materializing the establishment of just democracy
                        throughout the world. Perhaps in these words of President Wilson the peoples
                        of some of the countries of this continent will see reason for hope
                        Kaiserism has gone down to defeat in Germany. Let us hope that it will be
                        done away with wherever on this continent it still may nourish.</p>
                </quote>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Johnson</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
